To run on:
  Twitter: .env 
          TWITTER_USERNAME= # Account username
          TWITTER_PASSWORD= # Account password
          TWITTER_EMAIL=    # Account email
          TWITTER_2FA_SECRET= # could be needed

  # will need API access for more involved tools/actions

  Discord:
          DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN= # throttled context window 2000

  Farcaster:
          Go through neynar.com

  
